      "question": "已知复数 $z=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+i}{(1-\\sqrt{3}i)^2}$，$\\bar z$ 是 $z$ 的共轭复数，则 $z\\bar z=$（　　）",
      "options": [
        "$\\frac{1}{4}$",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}$",
        "1",
        "2"
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "solution": "因为 $z\\bar z=|z|^2$，且 $|z|=\\frac{|\\sqrt{3}+i|}{|1-\\sqrt{3}i|^2}=\\frac{2}{2^2}=\\frac{1}{2}$，所以 $z\\bar z=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{4}$。故选 A。",
